chester bennington 'he's wife breaks her  silence after his death a week after the  Lincoln Park singer was found dead of a  suicide by hanging his wife - Linda  Bennington is speaking out in a  statement to ET the 40 year old model  who married Chester in 2006 and is the  mother of their son Tyler and twin  daughters Lili and Lila said quote we  had a fairytale life and now it has  turned into some sick Shakespearean  tragedy how do I move on how do I pick  up my shattered soul adding the only  answer I know is to raise our babies  with every ounce of love I have I want  to let my community and the fans  worldwide know that we feel your love  may God bless us all and help us turn to  one another when we are in pain Chester  would have wanted us to do so rest in  peace my love the late singer was found  dead at his home in California the  morning of July 20th Linkin Park was  touring for their seventh studio album  when he died the remainder of the tour  has been cancelled in the wake of his  death
 

